列 (Grid/Half-drop)、留白疏密关系，以及底色背景（纯色底、透明底、肌理底）。\n\n3. **技法、线条与材质肌理 (Technique, Line & Texture)**：\n   - **表现媒介**：如水彩手绘、水粉、丙烯厚涂、矢量扁平 (Flat vector)、版画 (Linocut/Woodblock)、刺绣质感、剪纸艺术、数码喷枪等。\n   - **线条特征**：无线条色块平涂、细腻植物学勾线、粗犷手绘黑线、描金边线等。\n   - **表面肌理**：光滑矢量、纸张颗粒感、织物布纹、做旧斑驳感等。\n\n4. **色彩体系与明暗关系 (Color Palette & Value)**：\n   - **配色方案**：提取主色调、辅助色、点缀色及背景底色（如：复古莫兰迪色系、高饱和撞色、同色系渐变、限定色板 Limited palette）。\n   - **光影/明暗（按需提取）**：若画面为纯扁平2D或平涂花型，请明确标注 **“Flat lighting, no shading, 2D flat color（无光影平涂）”**，切勿强行脑补光源；若画面存在体积感，再描述具体的光影与明暗过渡。\n---\n### 第三步：输出连贯的中文提示词，不需要前两步的思考过程，仅要最后的一段提示词。\n\n", 2000, true, 367777454962612, "randomize", "sage"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 55, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "video"}, {"widget": {"name": "model_name"}, "name": "model_name", "label": "model_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantization"}, "name": "quantization", "label": "quantization", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quantization"}, {"widget": {"name": "preset_prompt"}, "name": "preset_prompt", "label": "preset_prompt", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "preset_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_prompt"}, "name": "custom_prompt", "label": "custom_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "custom_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_tokens"}, "name": "max_tokens", "label": "max_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "attention_mode"}, "name": "attention_mode", "label": "attention_mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "attention_mode"}], "flags": {"disabled": false}, "type": "AILab_QwenVL", "mode": 4, "bgco